WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.375
An element is made of only one type of atom.

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.075
Oxygen, helium and water particles, mixed together.

3
00:00:10.097 --> 00:00:14.547
Oxygen: two atoms joined, but both are oxygen. An element.

4
00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:20.605
Helium: single atoms, all one type. Also an element.

5
00:00:22.512 --> 00:00:27.337
Water has hydrogen and oxygen atoms: two types, so not an element.
